Suddenly, my younger sister Sofia appears on the screen.
She takes the phone from my parents.
Sofia is very happy.
I say to her, "How are you, Sofia?"
Sofia laughs and says, "I am fine, Maya!"
We both joke around and laugh.
Then I pick up my mobile phone.
I open a photo on my phone.
I hold my phone in front of the laptop's camera.
It is a photo of me and another girl.
I show this photo to Sofia.
Sofia looks at the photo carefully.
She asks, "Who is this with you?"
I smile and answer.
"This is Asha."
"She is my first friend."
"She is also my neighbour."
"She lives right in my building."
